               'privacy_body': 'DolbomOn is a daily communication tool for recording an older adult’s routine, activities, daily support, supplies, and notes '
                               'to share with family.\\n\\n1. Resident names, room numbers, family contact details, daily logs, needed supplies, and notes are '
                               'stored on the user’s device. Eastern Wood Studio does not send or store this data on its own server.\\n\\n2. Photos are stored '
                               'in the app’s private storage. When the user shares through SMS, KakaoTalk, email, or another app, the selected content and '
                               'photos are passed to that service and are then handled under that service’s policy.\\n\\n3. DolbomOn is provided for '
                               'organizing everyday schedules, activities, daily assistance, supplies, and communication notes.\\n\\n4. Voice input may be '
                               'processed by the Android speech recognition service selected on the device. The DolbomOn developer does not store voice data '
                               'on its own server.\\n\\n5. Google Mobile Ads (AdMob) is used to operate the free service. Google may process approximate '
                               'location derived from IP address, app interactions, diagnostics, and advertising identifiers for ad delivery, measurement, and '
                               'fraud prevention. DolbomOn does not provide resident names, photos, daily logs, or family contact details to advertising '
                               'systems for targeting.\\n\\n6. DolbomOn uses app locking, Android Keystore encryption for sensitive text, private app photo '
                               'storage, and recent-app screen protection.\\n\\n7. Encrypted backups are protected with a password chosen by the user and '
                               'saved to a location selected by the user. The developer does not know this password and cannot recover it.\\n\\n8. Local data '
                               'can be deleted with the in-app delete-all function or by clearing Android app data or uninstalling the app.\\n\\n9. Privacy '
                               'contact: Eastern Wood Studio / woodeastern2@gmail.com',
